# Frontend

## App Router

- Pages: `frontend/src/app/` — `/`, `/browse`, `/story/[slug]`, `/blindspot`, `/bias`, `/rumors`, `/pro`, `/sign-in`, `/sign-up`, `/offline`
- Layout: `layout.tsx` wires `ThemeProvider`, `SiteHeader`, `MobileNav`, `InstallPWA`; fonts Inter + Newsreader + Noto Sans Bengali
- Shared UI: `frontend/src/components/`
- Domain helpers: `frontend/src/lib/` (`api`, `stories`, `demo-data`, `perspectives`, `coverage`, `subscription-plans`, `supabase`)

## Data fetching

- Server components for listings and story pages; use `getTopStories`, `fetchClusters`, etc. from `lib/`
- Graceful degradation: catch API errors and empty states (see home page demo banner when `fromApi` is false)
- Client components for interactive UI (meters, tabs, modals, mobile nav, PWA install, theme toggle)

## Auth & Pro

- Supabase client: `lib/supabase.ts` — only active when `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL` and `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` are set
- Sign-in / sign-up pages under `/sign-in`, `/sign-up`
- Pro paywall UI: `PaywallModal` + plan copy from `subscription-plans.ts` (no live checkout yet)

## PWA

- `@ducanh2912/next-pwa` in Next config; service worker and install prompt in **production** builds only
- Offline shell: `/offline`; `InstallPWA` in root layout

## Types

- API shapes: exported from `lib/api.ts`
- Rich story UI: `Story`, `NewsSource` from `lib/demo-data.ts`
- Do not duplicate types across components; import from `lib/`

## UI notes

- Light/dark via `next-themes` (`ThemeProvider`, `ThemeToggle`); zinc palette, `font-display` for headings
- Keep BN strings alongside EN where the product already does
- Product components: `StoryFeedCard`, `HeadlineClashCard`, `HeadlineCompare`, `BiasMeter`, `RumorBadge`, `PerspectiveComparison`, `CoverageBar`, `SourceFilterList`, `StoryTabs`
